    "spec": "docs/LIF_DYNAMICS_SPEC.md",
    "note": "Every number in this receipt is a result of the CURRENT-based LIF v1 engine, whose membrane potential is unbounded and which self-sustains at ~1e6 spikes/s. The same preregistered protocol re-run under the conductance-based v2 engine gives a different answer: see docs/receipts/lif_dynamics_v2.json and docs/WP5_OPTOMOTOR.md section 11. This receipt is retained unchanged as the v1 result; it is not superseded in the sense of being wrong about v1."
